+## Sales and variance
+
+- `POST /import/sales` takes `{ "csv": "..." }` with the header
+  `ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty` and answers `{ "tickets": n, "dishes": n }`:
+  the new tickets imported and the dishes (sum of `qty`) they sold. Tickets
+  imported before are skipped. A bad row is `bad_request` and an item running
+  out is `sale_out_of_stock`; both name the row (`row 2` is the first data
+  row) and nothing from the file is imported.
